1
00:00:00,210 --> 00:00:01,310
(Leonard:)Oh, congratulations.

2
00:00:01,310 --> 00:00:04,650
(Leonard:)Have you broken it
to the troll yet?

3
00:00:04,650 --> 00:00:06,450
(Howard:)Did Penny tell you about that?

4
00:00:06,450 --> 00:00:08,420
(Leonard:)No. Steve Patterson told me.

5
00:00:08,420 --> 00:00:12,520
(Howard:)The greasy old fat guy
in Facilities Management?

6
00:00:12,530 --> 00:00:14,830
(Leonard:)Yeah.
How'd he know about it?

7
00:00:14,830 --> 00:00:17,630
(Leonard:)He's Glissinda the troll.

8
00:00:17,630 --> 00:00:19,330
(Raj(voice):)Sorry, dude,

9
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,330
(Raj(voice):)the thermostat's
on my side of the room,

10
00:00:21,330 --> 00:00:25,600
(Raj(voice):)so it stays Mumbai hot
in here until you turn off
that stupid Indian music!

11
00:00:25,610 --> 00:00:27,270
(Sheldon(voice):)I'll turn off the music

12
00:00:27,270 --> 00:00:29,710
(Sheldon(voice):)when you get rid of that
salmonella-ridden parakeet!

13
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:32,910
(Raj(voice):)Oh, too bad! Sheldon's
pathologically
afraid of birds!

14
00:00:32,910 --> 00:00:36,250
(Raj(voice):)Hey, look, Sheldon!
Birdie, birdie, birdie!

15
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:38,950
(Sheldon(voice):)That's it! Prepare
for marshmallow death!

16
00:00:38,950 --> 00:00:40,550
(Raj(voice):)Eat flaming Nerf!

17
00:00:50,530 --> 00:00:52,400
(Leonard:)So anyway...

18
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:54,800
(Leonard:)That's great news
about you and Bernadette.

19
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:57,270
(Howard:)Yeah. I think I'm gonna take
her to miniature golf.

20
00:00:57,270 --> 00:00:58,370
(Leonard:)Ah. Well, I guess

21
00:00:58,370 --> 00:01:01,410
(Leonard:)for you guys that's
like regular golf.

